{:edb/db-before-t 1245 :edb/db-after-t 1246 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534558 50 #inst "2026-10-08T00:53:06.666Z" 13194139534558 true] [17592186059467 1100 "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 0,-0.4,11 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 2,5,2 \\rangle$. Find $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}$." 13194139534558 false] [17592186059467 1100 "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 0,-0.4,11 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 2,5,2 \\rangle.$ Find $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}.$" 13194139534558 true] [17592186059467 1145 "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y}+{a}_{z}\\cdot {b}_{z} \\\\  & =0\\cdot 2+(-0.4)\\cdot 5+11\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =0-2+22 \\\\  & =20\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534558 true] [17592186059467 1145 "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain:\n\n$$\\begin{array}{rl}\\mathbf{a} \\cdot  \\mathbf{b} & = {a}_{x} \\cdot  {b}_{x} + {a}_{y} \\cdot  {b}_{y} + {a}_{z} \\cdot  {b}_{z} \\\\  & = 0 \\cdot  2 + ( - 0.4 ) \\cdot  5 + 11 \\cdot  2 \\\\  & = 0 - 2 + 22 \\\\  & = 20\\end{array}$$" 13194139534558 false] [17592186059468 1100 "Let \n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c}4 \\\\ - 2 \\\\ 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n and \n\n$$\n\\mathbf{b} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c}- 2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ t\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n. Given that $\\mathbf{a} \\perp \\mathbf{b}$, find the value of $t$." 13194139534558 false] [17592186059468 1100 "Let $[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ t\\end{aligned}]$. Given that $\\mathbf{a} \\perp \\mathbf{b}$, find the value of $t$." 13194139534558 true] [17592186059468 1145 "We know that $\\mathbf{a} \\perp \\mathbf{b}$ ($\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are perpendicular) if and only if\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b} = 0\n$$\n\nComputing the dot product, we have\n\n$$\\begin{array}{rl}\\mathbf{a} \\cdot  \\mathbf{b} & = {a}_{x} \\cdot  {b}_{x} + {a}_{y} \\cdot  {b}_{y} + {a}_{z} \\c