-12 \\\\  & =2{r}^{2}-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g\\cdot h & =0 \\\\ 2{r}^{2}-12 & =0 \\\\ 2{r}^{2} & =12 \\\\ {r}^{2} & =6 \\\\ r & =\\pm \\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe disregard the positive solution since we are told that $r<0.$ Therefore, $r=-\\sqrt{6}.$" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295310 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295311 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295312 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295313 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295314 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1041 "selection" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295312 13194139534558 true] [17592186295309 1110 #uuid "edd6a8a9-ca60-56e7-a1c6-4bd13fd66694" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295310 1034 "-\\sqrt{12}" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295310 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534558 true] [17592186295310 1111 #uuid "37971105-c43c-5ba0-ab46-037839975f37" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295311 1034 "-3" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295311 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534558 true] [17592186295311 1111 #uuid "57f0ac27-9fa0-5dd2-91df-cd19a59d18a1" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295312 1034 "-\\sqrt{6}" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295312 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534558 true] [17592186295312 1111 #uuid "bcb50249-8d55-5082-9855-02174c0caed2" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295313 1034 "-12" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295313 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534558 true] [17592186295313 1111 #uuid "2eb9dbe7-f10b-53d3-823f-d8b8de791bce" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295314 1034 "-6" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295314 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534558 true] [17592186295314 1111 #uuid "39cc4771-47ed-5369-9295-727f333c1a28" 13194139534558 true] [17592186295315 1017 #edb